{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "3f75bbf1-8d9a-475a-b0c5-8bf8eb086c98",
    "name": "Kafka Express E-Commerce Platform",
    "description": "# Kafka Express E-Commerce Platform API Collection\n\nEvent-driven microservices e-commerce platform communicating asynchronously via Apache Kafka with JWT authentication, role-based access control (RBAC), Elasticsearch full-text indexing, Prometheus metrics, and Server-Sent Events (SSE).\n\n## Architecture Overview\n- **API Gateway (`:8000`)**: Single reverse proxy entry point. Verifies JWT Bearer tokens and injects trusted internal headers (`x-user-id`, `x-user-email`, `x-user-role`).\n- **Auth Service (`:3006`)**: User registration, login, JWT access tokens (15m expiry), and Redis-backed refresh tokens (7d TTL).\n- **Product Service (`:3007`)**: Catalog search and product management. Public read access, admin-only write operations.\n- **Order Service (`:3001`)**: Order checkout, state tracking, and SSE status streaming (`/api/events`). Emits `OrderCreatedEvent` to Kafka topic `orders`.\n- **Payment Service (`:3002`)**: Kafka worker consuming `orders`. Simulates payments with retry backoff and DLQ routing.\n- **Delivery Service (`:3003`)**: Kafka worker consuming `payments`. Updates status through PREPARING -> SHIPPED -> DELIVERED.\n- **Search Service (`:3005`)**: Elasticsearch indexer and full-text search engine.\n- **Analytics Service (`:3004`)**: Real-time sliding window aggregations and Prometheus metrics exporter.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
